      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>去欲望吧，将所欲之物尽数吞噬。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>去披戴吧，然后毫不吝惜地吞下。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>去渴求吧，将所求之物毫无顾忌地耗尽。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_4",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>去欲望吧。如此便会被披戴。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_1",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>虽能填满却不去填满。虽能享用却就此停歇。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>勿使溢出，依序而行。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>切勿违背纪律。西西弗铭记你们所承受的一切痛苦。</color>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
